     "abs_off": 12848,
     "hex": "",
     "len": 198
    }
   },
   "why": "EXP-0155's configuration re-authored (BGRA8Unorm, 1 RT, 1 sample, four scalar varyings written as literals so the compiler may fold them into the pack's own `val` immediate). This is the CONTROL that reproduces the prior unstable result; its two pack occurrences are ONE carrier, which is exactly what EXP-0164 mis-counted as two."
  },
  "r_fcp1s": {
   "archive_sha256": "faee1368ee2afa3efd62d8f841c655ef1989999b2170043443e8d839d03a81e4",
   "carrier_dim": "1 RT, 8-bit unorm, 4x MSAA tile path",
