    }
   },
   "why": "The CONTROL half of the pair, and the one EXP-0155 used alone. At one sample the centroid, the sample point and the pixel centre coincide, so a field selecting among them cannot express itself. Kept explicitly so an inert result here is reported as the carrier's blindness rather than the field's inertness."
  },
