     "hex": "0cdd10069f115402030000cc10041b032f83000200000000a70754020304ac200b012f830002000000000b002004a70754000300ac2019032ec1a2b04202000429012ec1a2b0420200083c80233e0000000c40604b00260040000010000057265402004049005746540420404a0057165400404048005786540660404b005706550880404c000e000000",
     "len": 138
    }
   },
   "why": "Two raster order groups (float group 0, uint group 1) where group 1's increment derives from group 0's post-update value. Ordering failure can present as an INCONSISTENCY BETWEEN the two resources, a third distinct signature, and it puts two independent pixel_order brackets with different scope in one program."
  },
  "r_rog8": {
   "archive_sha256": "9ca78113ed13d788023d706dce2e792117b1b6dfb72272d693de45867c2dbdd6",
