     "hex": "",
     "len": 198
    }
   },
   "why": "Reproduces EXP-0147's blind shape on purpose: ONE user varying, so `slot` -- which selects WHICH output slot -- has nothing to select. If slot moves nothing here and something on r_v8/r_v4v/r_vsrc, the EXP-0147 null is a carrier limitation, not a hardware don't-care."
  },
  "r_v8f": {
   "archive_sha256": "bd6960836eba49eddea7be1a58885ceb075d96d520ba64480c368b369943f175",
